  }

The SketchVLM paper itself builds on prior work introducing the grid-anchored
stroke-output prompting style:

  SketchAgent: Language-Driven Sequential Sketch Generation
  Yael Vinker et al.
  https://sketch-agent.csail.mit.edu/
